{"name":"Out of Plumb","hex":"#9c909c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"out of plumb","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Prepositional phrase","definitions":["Not vertical."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/out_of_plumb"}],"entries":[{"title":"Plumb (singer)","blocks":[{"text":"Tiffany Arbuckle Lee, better known by her stage name Plumb, is an American singer-songwriter and author. Plumb has sold more than 500,000 albums and over two million singles worldwide, co-penned songs for numerous other artists, including Michelle Branch, Mandisa, Mandy Moore, Jaci Velasquez, and Natalie Grant, and had music placed in many films and television shows. Originally signed as a contemporary Christian music recording artist in 1997, Plumb is now known as well as or better in alternative rock and EDM, and for the use of her music in film and television than she is in the contemporary Christian music market."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Plumb_singing.jpg/330px-Plumb_singing.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plumb_(singer)","wikidata":"Q457525"},{"title":"Plumb (tools)","blocks":[{"text":"Plumb is a brand of hand tools owned by Apex Tool Group. The brand is known for its hammers and hatchets."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Plumb_logo.svg/330px-Plumb_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plumb_(tools)","wikidata":"Q18636756"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Plumb_Lifest_2017.jpg/500px-Plumb_Lifest_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Plumb_Lifest_2017.jpg/1280px-Plumb_Lifest_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wi